,\"figcaption\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":\"QPage Design Tokens\"}]]}]\n44:[\"$\",\"figure\",\"7\",{\"className\":\"flex flex-col gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L3f\",null,{\"src\":\"/work/qpage/dsm.webp\",\"alt\":\"The QPage design system: date pickers, forms, buttons, toggles and steppers\",\"sizes\":\"(min-width: 1280px) 1118px, 100vw\",\"ratio\":1.6359918200408998,\"fit\":\"contain\",\"className\":\"$undefined\"}],[\"$\",\"figcaption\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":\"QPage DSM\"}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"46:[\"$\",\"div\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"flex flex-col gap-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[28px] font-medium leading-8 text-foreground/80\",\"children\":\"User flow mapping\"}],null,[[\"$\",\"p\",\"After a careful round of user interviews, we identified an opportunity to empower customers to engage their candidate pool more effectively by providing scenario-based sequences and cohort campaigns. To bring this vision to life, I mapped the user flow and sitemap to ensure a seamless experience, allowing users to easily create and manage these targeted campaigns. This approach aims to enhance candidate engagement by delivering personalized and relevant content at the right stages of their journey.\",{\"className\":\"text-lg leading-[27px] text-foreground/80\",\"children\":\"After a careful round of user interviews, we identified an opportunity to empower customers to engage their candidate pool more effectively by providing scenario-based sequences and cohort campaigns. To bring this vision to life, I mapped the user flow and sitemap to ensure a seamless experience, allowing users to easily create and manage these targeted campaigns. This approach aims to enhance candidate engagement by delivering personalized and relevant content at the right stages of their journey.\"}]]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"47:[\"$\",\"figure\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"flex flex-col gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L3f\",null,{\"src\":\"/work/qpage/user-flow.webp\",\"alt\":\"User flow for creating and managing sequence campaigns\",\"sizes\":\"(min-width: 1280px) 1118px, 100vw\",\"ratio\":2.5296442687747036,\"fit\":\"contain\",\"className\":\"$undefined\"}],null]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"48:[\"$\",\"div\",\"5\",{\"className\":\"flex flex-col gap-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[28px] font-medium leading-8 text-foreground/80\",\"children\":\"What we learned\"}],null,[[\"$\",\"p\",\"Talking to 15 recruiters and hiring managers, the pattern was consistent: passive candidates weren't lost because teams stopped wanting them — they were lost because nothing kept the relationship warm in between roles. 80% said candidates went cold after initial contact, and once that happened, re-engaging them later took more effort than sourcing someone new. The talent pool was full of people who had already said yes once and would never be asked again.\",{\"className\":\"text-lg leading-[27px] text-foreground/80\",\"children\":\"Talking to 15 recruiters and hiring managers, the pattern was consistent: passive candidates weren't lost because teams stopped wanting them — they were lost because nothing kept the relationship warm in between roles. 80% said candidates went cold after initial contact, and once that happened, re-engaging them later took more effort than sourcing someone new. The talent pool was full of people who had already said yes once and would never be asked again.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"The cause was structural rather than motivational. There was no systematic way to nurture over time, so outreach happened whenever someone remembered — inconsistent in timing, tone, and content. What did happen was entirely manual: recruiters described spending hours writing follow-ups and tracking who had been contacted when, work that scaled linearly with pool size and got dropped first whenever an active req heated up. The cost showed up downstream, where 67% linked their inability to maintain warm relationships directly to longer time-to-fill. Every new role started from cold outreach because the warm relationships had quietly expired.\",{\"className\":\"text-lg leading-[27px] text-foreground/80\",\"children\":\"The cause was structural rather than motivational. There was no systematic way to nurture over time, so outreach happened whenever someone remembered — inconsistent in timing, tone, and content. What did happen was entirely manual: recruiters described spending hours writing follow-ups and tracking who had been contacted when, work that scaled linearly with pool size and got dropped first whenever an active req heated up. The cost showed up downstream, where 67% linked their inability to maintain warm relationships directly to longer time-to-fill. Every new role started from cold outreach because the warm relationships had quietly expired.\"}]]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"49:[\"$\",\"div\",\"6\",{\"className\":\"flex flex-col gap-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[28px] font-medium leading-8 text-foreground/80\",\"children\":\"Goal\"}],null,[[\"$\",\"p\",\"Create possibilities to effectively engage passive candidates, keeping them connected and interested, so they remain viable options for future hiring needs.\",{\"className\":\"text-lg leading-[27px] text-foreground/80\",\"children\":\"Create possibilities to effectively engage passive candidates, keeping them connected and interested, so they remain viable options for future hiring needs.\"}]]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"4a:[\"$\",\"div\",\"7\",{\"className\":\"flex flex-col gap-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[28px] font-medium leading-8 text-foreground/80\",\"children\":\"Prioritization\"}],null,[[\"$\",\"p\",\"To ensure the most impactful delivery, we prioritized features based on user needs and business value. The sequence feature was prioritized first, enabling users to create tailored engagement flows. Next, the cohort feature was emphasized to allow for targeted campaigns based on candidate segmentation. Finally, the Contact CRM was integrated to streamline the management and tracking of candidate interactions, ensuring a cohesive and efficient nurturing process.\",{\"className\":\"text-lg leading-[27px] text-foreground/80\",\"children\":\"To ensure the most impactful delivery, we prioritized features based on user needs and business value. The sequence feature was prioritized first, enabling users to create tailored engagement flows. Next, the cohort feature was emphasized to allow for targeted campaigns based on candidate segmentation. Finally, the Contact CRM was integrated to streamline the management and tracking of candidate interactions, ensuring a cohesive and efficient nurturing process.\"}]]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"4b:[\"$\",\"figure\",\"8\",{\"className\":\"flex flex-col gap-3 mx-auto w-full max-w-[560px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L3f\",null,{\"src\":\"/work/qpage/prioritization.webp\",\"alt\":\"Prioritization matrix sorting features into do now, do next, do later and don't do\",\"sizes\":\"560px\",\"ratio\":1.0970927043335161,\"fit\":\"contain\",\"className\":\"$undefined\"}],null]}]\n50:[\"$\",\"figure\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"flex flex-col gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L3f\",null,{\"src\":\"/work/qpage/nurturing-designs.webp\",\"alt\":\"Sequence Campaign screens: creating a sequence, its steps and the campaign table\",\"sizes\":\"(min-width: 1280px) 1118px, 100vw\",\"ratio\":1.2992285830288266,\"fit\":\"contain\",\"className\":\"$undefined\"}],null]}]\n51:[\"$\",\"div\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"relative aspect-video overflow-clip rounded-[24px] bg-neutral-950\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"iframe\",null,{\"src\":\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/plVxTgC9PrM\",\"title\":\"How to create a sequence in QPage\",\"loading\":\"lazy\",\"allow\":\"accelerometer; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\",\"allowFullScreen\":true,\"referrerPolicy\":\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\",\"className\":\"absolute inset-0 size-full border-0\"}]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"52:[\"$\",\"p\",\"The cost landed on quality, not just speed. Without advanced filtering or AI-assisted recommendations, strong candidates stayed buried in databases the team already owned, people who had applied before, been screened, and been forgotten. The pattern is the same one that showed up in nurturing from the other direction: the pool was an asset nobody could actually reach into, so every search behaved as though it were starting from nothing.\",{\"className\":\"text-lg leading-[27px] text-foreground/80\",\"children\":\"The cost landed on quality, not just speed. Without advanced filtering or AI-assisted recommendations, strong candidates stayed buried in databases the team already owned, people who had applied before, been screened, and been forgotten. The pattern is the same one that showed up in nurturing from the other direction: the pool was an asset nobody could actually reach into, so every search behaved as though it were starting from nothing.\"}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"53:[\"$\",\"div\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"flex flex-col gap-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[28px] font-medium leading-8 text-foreground/80\",\"children\":\"Goal\"}],null,[[\"$\",\"p\",\"Develop an AI-driven search engine that enables users to efficiently find and match with the most suitable profiles.\",{\"className\":\"text-lg leading-[27px] text-foreground/80\",\"children\":\"Develop an AI-driven search engine that enables users to efficiently find and match with the most suitable profiles.\"}]]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"54:[\"$\",\"div\",\"5\",{\"className\":\"flex flex-col gap-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[28px] font-medium leading-8 text-foreground/80\",\"children\":\"Designs\"}],null,[[\"$\",\"p\",\"I moved into wireframes quickly rather than polishing concepts, sketching the search experience as low-fidelity screens I could put in front of recruiters within days. The core question was how much structure to expose: enough filtering to feel precise, but not so much that we recreated the Boolean problem in a new skin. So I prototyped a faceted filter rail alongside a natural-language query field, with results carrying match reasoning inline, the point being that a recruiter should be able to type what they want and then narrow by clicking, never by remembering syntax. I built several fidelity levels of the same flow in parallel so I could test the interaction model before committing to visual detail, iterating on filter grouping, default states, and how results ranked and explained themselves across successive rounds until recruiters could get to a shortlist without asking anyone how the search worked.\",{\"className\":\"text-lg leading-[27px] text-foreground/80\",\"children\":\"I moved into wireframes quickly rather than polishing concepts, sketching the search experience as low-fidelity screens I could put in front of recruiters within days. The core question was how much structure to expose: enough filtering to feel precise, but not so much that we recreated the Boolean problem in a new skin. So I prototyped a faceted filter rail alongside a natural-language query field, with results carrying match reasoning inline, the point being that a recruiter should be able to type what they want and then narrow by clicking, never by remembering syntax. I built several fidelity levels of the same flow in parallel so I could test the interaction model before committing to visual detail, iterating on filter grouping, default states, and how results ranked and explained themselves across successive rounds until recruiters could get to a shortlist without asking anyone how the search worked.\"}]]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"55:[\"$\",\"figure\",\"6\",{\"className\":\"flex flex-col gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L3f\",null,{\"src\":\"/work/qpage/search-wireframes.webp\",\"alt\":\"Low-fidelity wireframes of the search screen with a filter rail and result list\",\"sizes\":\"(min-width: 1280px) 1118px, 100vw\",\"ratio\":1.791044776119403,\"fit\":\"contain\",\"className\":\"$undefined\"}],null]}]\n56:[\"$\",\"figure\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"flex flex-col gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L3f\",null,{\"src\":\"/work/qpage/usability-1.webp\",\"alt\":\"Round 1 of the usability study: tasks, results and what broke\",\"sizes\":\"(min-width: 1280px) 1118px, 100vw\",\"ratio\":1.7777777777777777,\"fit\":\"contain\",\"className\":\"$undefined\"}],null]}]\n57:[\"$\",\"figure\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"flex flex-col gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L3f\",null,{\"src\":\"/work/qpage/usability-2.webp\",\"alt\":\"Round 2: what changed, and the before and after results\",\"sizes\":\"(min-width: 1280px) 1118px, 100vw\",\"ratio\":1.7777777777777777,\"fit\":\"contain\",\"className\":\"$undefined\"}],null]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"58:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"Increase in MRR from AI Search\",{\"className\":\"rounded-[24px] border border-border/50 bg-secondary flex flex-col gap-2 px-[25px] py-[39px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[56px] font-medium leading-none\",\"children\":\"13%\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm leading-[22px] text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":\"Increase in MRR from AI Search\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"Mean trust in the search, out of 5\",{\"className\":\"rounded-[24px] border border-border/50 bg-secondary flex flex-col gap-2 px-[25px] py-[39px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[56px] font-medium leading-none\",\"children\":\"2.9 → 4.4\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm leading-[22px] text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":\"Mean trust in the search, out of 5\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"Time to first shortlist\",{\"className\":\"rounded-[24px] border border-border/50 bg-secondary flex flex-col gap-2 px-[25px] py-[39px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[56px] font-medium leading-none\",\"children\":\"7:40 → 4:10\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm leading-[22px] text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":\"Time to first shortlist\"}]]}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"59:[\"$\",\"div\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"flex flex-col gap-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[28px] font-medium leading-8 text-foreground/80\",\"children\":\"Impact and lessons\"}],null,[[\"$\",\"p\",\"AI Search drove a 13% increase in MRR. Recruiters stopped losing hours to Boolean syntax and fragmented tools, and the databases they already owned finally became searchable. Candidates who had applied before and been forgotten started surfacing in results instead of staying buried.\",{\"className\":\"text-lg leading-[27px] text-foreground/80\",\"children\":\"AI Search drove a 13% increase in MRR. Recruiters stopped losing hours to Boolean syntax and fragmented tools, and the databases they already owned finally became searchable. Candidates who had applied before and been forgotten started surfacing in results instead of staying buried.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"The lesson came directly out of testing. The first round of sessions failed not because the model was weak but because nothing in the interface showed what it could do. Recruiters typed keyword strings, got literal matches, and concluded the search wasn't smart. Once the query echoed back what it understood and every result explained its own match, the same underlying system read as capable. Trust moved from 2.9 to 4.4 without a single change to ranking.\",{\"className\":\"text-lg leading-[27px] text-foreground/80\",\"children\":\"The lesson came directly out of testing. The first round of sessions failed not because the model was weak but because nothing in the interface showed what it could do. Recruiters typed keyword strings, got literal matches, and concluded the search wasn't smart. Once the query echoed back what it understood and every result explained its own match, the same underlying system read as capable. Trust moved from 2.9 to 4.4 without a single change to ranking.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"So the win came from removing a skill requirement rather than adding intelligence. The clearest signal was that participants with low Boolean confidence ended up performing the same as the high confidence ones. Natural language plus clickable filters changed who could get a good result, not how good the best result could be, and that is what moved adoption. Worth remembering when the instinct is to make the model better before making the interface reachable.\",{\"className\":\"text-lg leading-[27px] text-foreground/80\",\"children\":\"So the win came from removing a skill requirement rather than adding intelligence. The clearest signal was that participants with low Boolean confidence ended up performing the same as the high confidence ones. Natural language plus clickable filters changed who could get a good result, not how good the best result could be, and that is what moved adoption. Worth remembering when the instinct is to make the model better before making the interface reachable.\"}]]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"5a:[\"$\",\"div\",\"5\",{\"className\":\"relative aspect-video overflow-clip rounded-[24px] bg-neutral-950\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"iframe\",null,{\"src\":\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/HYUo8PpDQZc\",\"title\":\"QPage AI Search walkthrough\",\"loading\":\"lazy\",\"allow\":\"accelerometer; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\",\"allowFullScreen\":true,\"referrerPolicy\":\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\",\"c